{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n黃澤林與康堤分手後火速戀上譚旻萱，女方隨即被網民強烈質疑無縫接軌。譚旻萱前男友區顯揚在社交平台連環發布限時動態，當中一張沾滿綠色顏料手掌照片瞬間引爆網絡熱話。這場牽涉多人的感情風波背後隱藏著令人震驚劈腿疑雲。\n</p>\n<h2>餐廳老闆前男友連環發文 疑暗示「被帽」</h2>\n<p>譚旻萱與黃澤林爆出新戀情後，其37歲餐廳老闆前男友區顯揚隨即在Instagram連續發布三個限時動態。他首先上載一張黑白照片，接著貼出一張沾滿綠色顏料手掌特寫，並配文表示「不如大家教下我點洗哩啲 水溶性色素仲好啦」。最後他再發布一張洗乾淨手掌照片，直指「冼面奶洗得甩 唔怪得啲女仔落咗妝差咁遠」。這系列極具暗示意味照片迅速在網絡瘋傳，大批網民推測他正以綠色顏料強烈暗示自己慘遭背叛並戴上綠帽。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱與區顯揚互相取消追蹤關係徹底決裂</h2>\n<p>面對外界對綠色手掌照片瘋狂揣測，區顯揚在社交平台明確表達不想再捲入女方私事。他在黑白動態中直言「識我嘅就唔好問我 唔好再send比我 我唔係幾想睇到 人哋嘅事我唔清楚」，強烈要求外界停止轉發相關資訊。目前譚旻萱與區顯揚已經在社交平台上互相取消追蹤，雙方關係正式畫上句號。女方至今尚未對無縫接軌及劈腿指控作出任何公開回應，令整件感情糾紛持續發酵。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱3月曾與舊愛穿情侶裝滑雪高調放閃</h2>\n<p>回顧譚旻萱過往情史，她於2023年曾大方認愛導演男友Christopher，當時更公開表示「好感激大家都畀適當空間我哋」。然而這段戀情悄悄結束後，她便與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀。就在今年3月，男方曾上載二人坐吊車去滑雪背影照，女伴身穿灰白色豹紋滑雪裝，而譚旻萱同一時期亦發布了穿著同款服裝單人照。</p>\n<h2>網民起底區顯揚曾參與戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後引發網民激烈討論，不少人留言直斥「換畫速度快過翻書」、「綠色手掌真係好大怨氣」。同時大批網民對區顯揚進行大起底，發現身高182cm他曾參與ViuTV戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》。他在節目中自爆擁有10次戀愛經驗，最長一段關係達6年，當時更與趙慧珊（Aka）擦出火花。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"qST3rKvF3piR_LJMvrvo51T3KOHYsOcWZgYKR2YGCkc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130956445532_18166637076ae018ce414d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"INgmFQrzzVSN2zZBk2TQsUvDv8Xzcti4Oirhhzoq4Yc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130956445532_18166637076ae018ce414d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>連環發文疑暗示「被帽」（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307131491539540_13564357826ae018d353d4f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"mcySqZqWpxTeM6-PhKjda4sKiwur9YvNZf9ojWX_aI0.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307131491539540_13564357826ae018d353d4f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大批網民推測他正以綠色顏料強烈暗示自己慘遭背叛並戴上綠帽。（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930713182323305_17118304496ae018d67d6ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wOfAII7AD_BDzyL091grK-wW6U9Z7X1X7RN8XO0TfFw.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930713182323305_17118304496ae018d67d6ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>疑似嘲諷女方落妝差得遠（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132052268357_4232655406ae018d913b58.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"austinauhinyeung_1773580675_3853396394477068339_207965317.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132052268357_4232655406ae018d913b58.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾上載二人坐吊車去滑雪背影照（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132351527122_3689892056ae018dbca7f7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"uorHjVaVAt0FlFBlFULLUF2zInn3c4X-TJFa90yRWvc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132351527122_3689892056ae018dbca7f7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱同一時期亦發布了穿著同款服裝單人照（圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132608343043_455189496ae018de67f85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"austinauhinyeung_1773580675_3853396115773965509_207965317.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132608343043_455189496ae018de67f85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132737354485_20205668256ae018dfa7ee4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ACtLNOGy67KPjIGEPPS4rfOnQHkJcavConBRC6JwUQs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307132737354485_20205668256ae018dfa7ee4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>區顯揚曾參與戀愛真人騷《35+LOVE》,與趙慧珊（Aka）擦出火花（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 康堤 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:39.755505+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1442,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:22:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:25.845918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:25.845918+00:00","content_hash":"0114bc7dc26d3611dfd9ac1f1d13f35b6cb51dacad198588ba5d949d89d3a858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}